The ideal candidate is professional and honest with an open, no-nonsense attitude. You function independently, you have a helicopter view, and you switch quickly; you are flexible and accurate in your work and foresee the consequences of your actions; you are a discreet and intelligent team player that people feel comfortable with; you are both a doer and a thinker with excellent social, communication and organisational skills.
A Bachelor’s/Master’s degree
Equivalent broad experience (min. 5 years) in similar position in an international (and/or creative) environment;
